e_name": "screenshot02.png", "id": "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=F7Eg7M-URToQ7kNvwFqfrqr&_nc_oc=Adpcz0KWETJBAphm8j-YJ6CQcwdAThhiqsFjGpRfJNQky_4lK-F5E6eYvKuBHt_gHn0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPe9BRn6qjSotMBQawOd2dFWilRerIfw6PsHTJBF1vKEg&oe=6AE36179"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2-ylXZ2e260Q7kNvwH_CZr9&_nc_oc=AdpLDkDfnDU1Ls7ZMSVjuXeSKiceEehKUxB1NkijbNM_JhbnoeFbwShKC66L08wQD8c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNdOPUXY7A3N52EXgCTqtmFj0ZCFmQ4G94R59NYSq-Smg&oe=6AE338D3"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=F6JPSsX997IQ7kNvwHqQsto&_nc_oc=AdpDbkHC2TZ4MrpWibZ8DdZgHw4cj7aiguKvejLg5qZ3PPxRolVua98XXHJGVUXPb0Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN25lbHEZq4W2o9wwnnUt3Gq-yJyT6tk6tn54jVmqDr3A&oe=6AE3447B"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bAY-dBLZIQMQ7kNvwERN3Mg&_nc_oc=AdrBylyzMDYFSy_CudxzDw8uBuHJCLjtde17SYrZTGPrp527NmM4mLb9EPFDb0pp9wM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP_N3gGvxn1PKDtW2wrt9Qtu550x89eii2a8pHK-m249w&oe=6AE345CA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=H0P_6uWRxGwQ7kNvwFMVKaj&_nc_oc=AdrE4dtKaiRnjS7QGV5c8dn4Mpzm6WvVwNCsNMMxJba7QC2p2FEa3YOQAMsv7mAeEzY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMpimmErid8QOMdBg9dvz1FXbbXfxzcWyDa28EzR_5Ysg&oe=6AE3673E"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_se